# ─── Claude Code: private & runtime data — never track in the PUBLIC dotfiles repo ───
# Private content is version-controlled in the second bare repo (dotfiles-private),
# which force-adds the few paths it owns. The pre-commit guardrail (core.hooksPath =
# ~/.claude/.guardrail) is the hard backstop against accidental leaks.
.claude/CLAUDE.private.md
.claude/DOTFILES-PRIVATE.md
.claude/.guardrail/
.claude/projects/
.claude/history.jsonl
.claude/sessions/
.claude/session-data/
.claude/session-env/
.claude/shell-snapshots/
.claude/telemetry/
.claude/file-history/
.claude/paste-cache/
.claude/backups/
.claude/plans/
.claude/tasks/
.claude/ide/
.claude/jobs/
.claude/downloads/
.claude/cache/
.claude/daemon/
.claude/daemon.log
.claude/daemon-auth-status.json
.claude/daemon-auth-cooldown
.claude/remote-settings.json
.claude/policy-limits.json
.claude/mcp-needs-auth-cache.json
.claude/.last-update-result.json
.claude/.last-cleanup
